   "signal": "pp-doclayoutv3",
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "ten specimens. Growing conditions were the same as\nthose used for commercial production. All plants in the\ntrial had been in the ground 18 months under natural\nconditions. Also included, for interest, in the table for\ncomparison are data for \u2018Venezia\u2019 from comparative\ngrowing trials conducted at Alsmeer, Netherlands in 1987-\n88. These trials were conducted by the testing authorities\n(CR2) in accordance with UPOV guidelines TG/59/3 over\ntwo growing periods under conditions ensuring normal\ngrowth.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
